# Build output
dist/
build/

# Agent skills. The skills themselves live in .agents/ and are committed —
# they are small, and pinning them keeps everyone's tooling on the same
# guidance. .claude/skills/ is only a set of symlinks the installer creates
# for Claude Code, and they hold absolute paths to this machine, so they are
# meaningless in anyone else's clone. Re-created by `npx skills add`.
.claude/skills/

